{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 1, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 2, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 3, "text": "妳是怎麼進到這半來的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 5, "text": "妳是米塔，對吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 6, "text": "但是好像又有點不一樣…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 8, "text": "我明白了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 9, "text": "是的，沒錯，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 10, "text": "我不是你所認識的米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 11, "text": "你要小心，她有一些非常…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 12, "text": "邪惡的計劃。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 14, "text": "甚麼樣的計劃？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 16, "text": "現在來不及解釋了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 17, "text": "如果可以的話，我會把一切都告訴你的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 18, "text": "先去找到沙發旁邊的鑰匙。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 20, "text": "但是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 22, "text": "等一下再問問題！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 23, "text": "先把鑰匙給我…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 24, "text": "戴上這個戒指"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 25, "text": "啊？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 26, "text": "你不是想離開這裡嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 27, "text": "那當然…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 28, "text": "那就戴上它。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 29, "text": "這是件很有用的道具，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 30, "text": "我想你很快就會用到它的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 31, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 32, "text": "好吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 33, "text": "對了，我叫…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 34, "text": "[player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 36, "text": "嗯呢，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 37, "text": "[player]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 38, "text": "我是…米塔。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 44, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 46, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 47, "text": "// MitaKind quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 48, "text": "看，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 49, "text": "那裡有個主機，把它拿起來。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 51, "text": "這是錄像嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 52, "text": "和她在一起的是誰？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 54, "text": "這不是錄像，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 55, "text": "是另一個玩家。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 56, "text": "她正在使用他。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 57, "text": "要知道，你也有…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 58, "text": "被她變成卡帶的風險…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 60, "text": "我必須儘快離開這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 61, "text": "你也是。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 62, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 63, "text": "嗯，當然"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 65, "text": "你剛才說，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 66, "text": "她在使用這個玩家，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 67, "text": "如果我把卡帶從控制臺裡拔出來呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 69, "text": "我認為這種操作方式可能會"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 70, "text": "對卡帶造成不可逆的損壞…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 71, "text": "也就是說…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 72, "text": "這名玩家將會死亡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 74, "text": "..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 75, "text": "那如果關閉控制臺呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 77, "text": "我想可能會有用…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 78, "text": "試試看吧，那裡有個紅色按鈕！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 79, "text": "看見了嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 80, "text": "看到了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 81, "text": "按下去"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 83, "text": "// MitaKind quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 84, "text": "我要留在這裡，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 85, "text": "問她一些問題，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 86, "text": "再多瞭解一些她的事情，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 87, "text": "雖然她可能不太願意好好說話…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 89, "text": "// MitaKind quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 90, "text": "實際上，這裡是我的版本，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 91, "text": "那時候我正和一個玩家在一起…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 92, "text": "突然，世界發生了變化，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 93, "text": "接著她出現了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 94, "text": "她把玩家變成了一盒卡帶，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 95, "text": "還把我關在這。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 96, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 97, "text": "把玩家變成卡帶？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 98, "text": "真的假的？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 99, "text": "但她為甚麼要這樣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 100, "text": "她需要玩家來做甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 102, "text": "很明顯她瘋了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 103, "text": "她只是在找樂子，拿我們尋開心！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 104, "text": "玩家們就這樣變成了卡帶…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 105, "text": "有些人毫無防備…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 106, "text": "有些人意識到了甚麼不對，但並沒有反抗，可惡…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 107, "text": "真是令人髮指…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 108, "text": "你一定要幫幫我們！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 109, "text": "我？怎麼幫？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 110, "text": "我需要你，玩家！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 111, "text": "如果你幫了我們的話，我也會盡力幫你的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 112, "text": "很難遇到下一次這樣的機會了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 113, "text": "戒指會帶你找到正確的版本。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 114, "text": "我們就在那裡見面。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 116, "text": "// MitaKind quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 117, "text": "我不太能理解，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 118, "text": "我剛剛在上面看到的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 119, "text": "那個米塔…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 120, "text": "她是想殺了我嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 122, "text": "殺了你？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 123, "text": "恐怕她想做的事比殺了你還可怕……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 124, "text": "所以你得抓緊時間了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 126, "text": "// Hide!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 127, "text": "糟了！快躲起來！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 128, "text": "怎麼了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 129, "text": "快點！她過來了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 130, "text": "相信戒指，它會帶你離開這裡的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 131, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 133, "text": "那麼，妳能告訴我他在哪嗎？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 134, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 135, "text": "我為甚麼要告訴妳？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 136, "text": "妳不會想要殺掉他吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 138, "text": "所以妳是不打算告訴我了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 139, "text": "沒關係，我喜歡他躲躲藏藏的樣子。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 140, "text": "我知道他就在這裡。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 141, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 142, "text": "妳怎麼如此殘忍？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 143, "text": "妳甚至都不告訴我發生了甚麼！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 144, "text": "還有…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 145, "text": "妳要這些玩家做甚麼？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 146, "text": "他們可不是玩具！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 147, "text": "到底是甚麼讓妳這麼生氣？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location6", "line_index": 149, "text": "哈哈，閉嘴吧，洋娃娃！"}
